      <section id="intro-actual" class="intro section-light reveal-section reveal-from-right"
        style="display: none; opacity: 0;" aria-labelledby="publication-title">
        <div class="shell intro-grid">
          <div class="section-label"><span class="label-line"></span><span>About the publication</span>
          </div>
          <div class="intro-content">
            <p class="eyebrow">From Regulation to Practical Implementation</p>
            <h2 id="publication-title">Move from knowing a DPIA is required to conducting one properly.</h2>
            <div class="intro-body">
              <div>
                <p>Data Privacy Impact Assessments are a critical part of responsible data governance, yet many
                  organisations still struggle with the practical question:</p>
                <blockquote>How do we move from knowing that a DPIA is required to conducting one properly, documenting
                  it
                  clearly and using it to support real decisions?</blockquote>
              </div>
              <div>
                <p><strong style="color:#000">DPIA Made Easy – Professional Edition</strong> was developed to bridge
                  that gap.</p>
                <p>The publication provides a structured, practical and governance-focused approach to DPIA
                  implementation, helping organisations and professionals identify high-risk processing, assess privacy
                  risks, develop proportionate mitigation measures and demonstrate accountability.</p>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>

    </div>

