            <p class="eyebrow">What DPIA Made Easy - Professional Edition Covers</p>
            <h2 id="workbook-title">A practical guideline containing ACE DPIA Made Easy Handbook, Workbook &amp;
              Training
              Guide.</h2>
            <p><strong>DPIA Made Easy – Professional Edition</strong> is more than a regular data protection guideline.
              It is a professional handbook, practical workbook and training guide: explaining the DPIA method, guiding
              hands-on exercises and supporting professionals through implementation from screening to approval and
              ongoing review.</p>
